3. **"quantity"**: An integer >= 0. If calling, set to 0.
4. **"face"**: An integer from 1 to 6. Ignored if calling.
5. **"utterance"**: Up to 50 tokens of what you'd say in-character (e.g., bluff, trash talk, etc.)

